cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Analysis pipeline for "Nerve remodeling in a Pax6 model of
  keratopathy"
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software and
  the associated manuscript.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Sneha
    name-particle: K.
    family-names: Mohan
    affiliation: >-
      Department of Cellular Biology, University of Georgia,
      Athens, GA 30602, USA
  - given-names: James
    name-particle: D.
    family-names: Lauderdale
    affiliation: >-
      Department of Cellular Biology, University of Georgia,
      Athens, GA 30602, USA
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7503-0528'
repository-code: '<REPO_URL>'
abstract: >-
  R pipeline for the curated-panel RNA-seq analysis reported in
  "Nerve remodeling in a Pax6 model of keratopathy". Assigns each
  gene in three curated panels (axon guidance, myelination,
  vascular/lymphatic) one of three expression states in every
  group, tests only those genes the data can support a
  quantitative comparison for, and reports every negative result
  as either bounded with the excluded effect size stated or as
  undetermined.
keywords:
  - RNA-seq
  - cornea
  - Pax6
  - axon guidance
  - differential expression
  - equivalence testing
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: '2026-08-09'

